    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d322">

                <pb facs="0841" n="811" xml:id="pg811"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">800.014 Antarctic/11–1449: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Embassy in Chile
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">confidential</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-11-14T18:00:00-05:00">November 14,
                            1949—6 p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>376. Chil and UK Embs confirm that exchange of notes renewing tripartite
                    understanding of Jan 18 will take place Nov 18 (Deptel 297, Sep 8.<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d322-f1"/>). Text of notes identical with previous text except for
                    omission word “routine”. Dept will issue press release similar release Jan 18
                    upon Emb Santiago confirmation exchange notes has taken place<anchor n="2"
                        xml:id="d322-f2"/> Chil desires our press release be issued same day.</p>
                <p>To Santiago as 376; London as 4101; BAires as 685.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Webb</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d322-f1" n="1" xml:id="d322-f1-content">
                <p>Not printed, but see footnote 2 to telegram 3729, September 16, from London, <ref
                        target="#pg809">p. 809</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d322-f2" n="2" xml:id="d322-f2-content">
                <p>For the text of the statement issued to the press on November 19, see Department
                    of State <hi rendition="#italic">Bulletin</hi>, November 28, 1949, p. 833.
                    Regarding the Department’s statement to the press of January 18, see the
                    editorial note, <ref target="#pg793">p. 793</ref>
                </p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
